  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "LC045 now reports a navigation read inside a local function that only iterates the materialized collection — the same loop written one level down, previously silenced because capturing the collection was treated as an escape. The reads are proven at the call site, so an escape before the call, an Include, a fix-up and an explicit load all apply unchanged. Requires one call site and a callee whose only use of the collection is iterating it.",
